[INFO] [STEP 140] verdict: COMPOSITION-CONFINED POST-2017 CARRIER: the declared-cap inbound-leg signal survives on uniform-legacy legs (p=0.00254) within that stratum, but the exploratory displaced-cap residual is nonsignificant on uniform-Gaia legs (p=0.209) and confined to catalogue-mixed legs (p=8.89e-07).  In-cap mixed members match out-of-cap on composition, leg contrast and epoch, so the confinement is not a composition main effect: the displaced structure is direction-specific only where legs mix reduction systems.  Read against TEP this weakens the displaced-axis/mirror inference -- a catalogue-stitching systematic confined to mixed legs is the more parsimonious account of the post-2017 carrier, while the pre-2018 declared signal and its leg morphology remain detectable within the legacy stratum; catalogue-by-sky interactions are unresolved
